{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"article-content\" id=\"artibody\">\n<p>公開信息顯示，2024年8月，宗馥莉接掌娃哈哈後，許思敏擔任娃哈哈集團監事，並在多家關聯公司擔任法定代表人、總經理等職務。</p><p>2025年10月，宗馥莉辭去娃哈哈集團董事長一職，許思敏被任命為娃哈哈集團總經理，同年11月，公司完成工商信息變更，許思敏任董事長兼法定代表人。</p><p><img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2025/1024/67e88b89be5804e.jpg\"></p> </div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.421151+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:15:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T11:30:37.169635+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:03.486087+00:00","content_hash":"09e4f09b5e252b5035ef962dfdc5bdf525fe6c8c441b50723ffe77a3978939a7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.421151+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}